Sep 2023
Philip Stone
Dec 2024

.
The ethnicity categories defined in the 2001 Census: https://www.ethnicity-facts-figures.service.gov.uk/style-guide/ethnic-groups/#2001-census. Rationale being that NHS Data Model and Dictionary still uses 2001 Census categories. See: https://github.com/opensafely/codelist-development/issues/126. An amalgamation of codelists created by Rohini Mathur and colleagues with some corrections I felt were necessary. 'Not Stated' codes were removed. Created for PRIORITY study.

